# id_map.json / event_id_map.json are deliberately NOT ignored -- they are
# the Bookeo<->SCS correlation tables and the ONLY thing that makes the push
# scripts idempotent (there is no Events read endpoint to rebuild them from).
# They hold opaque IDs + status + timestamps only, no names/emails/phones.
.id_map_*.tmp
__pycache__/
*.pyc
